### Status of a committed successful transfer
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/GetTransferStatus

{
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "tx-1"
  }
}

### Status of a committed failed transfer (insufficient funds)
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/GetTransferStatus

{
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "tx-2"
  }
}

### Status of a transfer that was never submitted — expects NOT_FOUND
GRPC {{host}}:{{port}}/bank.v1.BankService/GetTransferStatus

{
  "client_tx_id": {
    "id": "never-submitted"
  }
}

